<title>CANADA: George Weston Ltd Q3 shr up nine percent.</title>
<headline>George Weston Ltd Q3 shr up nine percent.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>third quarter ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$1.21		   C$1.11</p>
<p> Net			 54,500		   52,300</p>
<p> Revs		   3,822,300		3,664,000</p>
<p>			9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			 C$3.74		   C$2.78</p>
<p> Net			172,100		  131,200</p>
<p> Revs		   9,635,400	     10,004,300</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE: Net income for the nine-month period ended Sept. 30, 1996 included C$866.7 million gain on sale of Neilson</p>
<p>confectionary business on Jan. 2, 1996.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
